{% comment %}
  Custom Section
  Fully responsive with custom- prefixed classes
  Supports:
  - Background colors & gradient
  - Grid layout
  - Product / URL links
  - Titles
  - Buttons with icons
  - Card aspect ratios
  - Responsive padding & gaps
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid 
